    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Normalize personnummer to 12 digits (YYYYMMDDXXXX).\nconst body = $json.body || $json;\nconst pnrRaw = body.personnummer || null;\nconst attempt_id = body.attempt_id || String($execution.id);\nif (!pnrRaw) {\n  return [{ json: { ok: false, state: 'skipped', skipEbas: true, attempt_id,\n    message: 'Inget personnummer angivet' } }];\n}\nlet pnr = String(pnrRaw).replace(/\\D/g, '');\nif (pnr.length < 10) {\n  return [{ json: { ok: false, state: 'unavailable', error: 'invalid_input', skipEbas: true,\n    attempt_id, message: 'Ogiltigt personnummer-format' } }];\n}\nif (pnr.length === 10) {\n  const yy = parseInt(pnr.slice(0, 2), 10);\n  pnr = (yy > 30 ? '19' : '20') + pnr;\n}\nreturn [{ json: { _pnr_normalized: pnr, attempt_id, skipEbas: false } }];"
      },
      "name": "Normalize Personnummer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        320,
        208
      ],
      "id": "normalize-pnr",
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://ebas.sverok.se/apis/confirm_membership.json",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"request\": {\n    \"action\": \"confirm_membership\",\n    \"association_number\": \"{{ $env.EBAS_ASSOC }}\",\n    \"api_key\": \"{{ $env.EBAS_API_KEY }}\",\n    \"year_id\": {{ new Date().getFullYear() }},\n    \"socialsecuritynumber\": \"{{ $json._pnr_normalized }}\"\n  }\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 8000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": false,
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          },
          "redirect": {
            "redirect": {
              "followRedirects": false
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "Call eBas confirm_membership",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        208
      ],
      "id": "call-ebas-api",
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Only explicit booleans in a successful response can verify membership.\nconst attempt_id = $('Normalize Personnummer').first().json.attempt_id;\nconst hasBody = Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call($json, 'body');\nconst payload = hasBody ? $json.body : $json;\nconst status = $json.statusCode;\nconst validStatus = status === undefined ? !hasBody :\n  Number.isInteger(status) && status >= 200 && status < 300;\n// The presence of either error field is ambiguous, even with a false/null/empty value.\nconst hasError = value => value !== null && typeof value === 'object' &&\n  Object.entries(value).some(([key, child]) =>\n    key === 'error' || key === 'errors' ||\n    (key === 'request_result' && child !== 'success') || hasError(child));\nconst memberFound = payload?.response?.member_found;\nif (!validStatus || hasError($json) || typeof memberFound !== 'boolean') {\n  return [{ json: { ok: false, state: 'unavailable', error: 'api_unavailable', attempt_id,\n    message: 'eBas kunde inte verifieras' } }];\n}\nreturn [{ json: { ok: true, state: memberFound ? 'verified_true' : 'verified_false',\n  isMember: memberFound, attempt_id,\n  message: memberFound ? 'Medlem i Sverok' : 'Ej medlem i Sverok' } }];"
      },
      "name": "Parse Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
        208
      ],
      "id": "parse-response",
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## eBas Membership Check Sub-workflow\n\n**Purpose:** Verify if a person is a registered Sverok member.\n\n**Called by:** Check-in Orchestrator (HTTP Request node)\n\n**Why Sverok membership?**\nSwedish gaming associations require membership for insurance coverage at events.\nSverok is the Swedish Gaming Federation.\n\n**Input:**\n```json\n{\n  \"personnummer\": \"YYYYMMDDXXXX\"\n}\n```\n\n**Output:**\n```json\n{\n  \"isMember\": true/false,\n  \"message\": \"Medlem i Sverok\" / \"Ej medlem\"\n}\n```\n\n**Privacy:** Personnummer is NOT stored - only the boolean result.\nPersonnummer is cleared from localStorage after check-in.\n\n**Degraded:** Errors/malformed replies return ok:false, state:unavailable with no membership boolean. Missing input is state:skipped. Only an explicit API boolean verifies membership.\n\nT-048: Verified true/false keeps HTTP 200 JSON. Provider errors, timeouts and invalid replies return HTTP 503 text/plain: ebas_unavailable. This deliberately makes the member-card JSON decoder use its retry path.",
        "height": 596,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -320,
        -352
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "note-ebas-overview",
      "name": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Personnummer Normalization\n\nSwedish personnummer formats:\n- 12 digits: YYYYMMDDXXXX\n- 10 digits: YYMMDDXXXX\n- With dash: YYMMDD-XXXX\n\nThis node normalizes to 12-digit format.\nUses heuristic: YY > 30 → 19XX, else → 20XX",
        "height": 324,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        224,
        -352
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "note-ebas-normalize",
      "name": "Normalize"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## eBas API Call\n\n**Endpoint:** confirm_membership.json\n**Auth:** API key (env: EBAS_API_KEY)\n**Assoc:** F161215-9 (FGC Trollhättan)\n\nChecks if personnummer is registered as member for current year.",
        "height": 224,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
